  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Family Planning Services in Yemen Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The two-year Strengthening Family Planning Services in Yemen project will leverage existing activities to strengthen the quality of and access to FP services in 75 healthcare facilities across 6 Governorates. Strengthening Family Planning Services in Yemen Project in Yemen, will leverage established relationships and programming in the proposed target Governorates of Hodeida, Saada, Hajjah, Amran, Lahj and Sanaa.</narrative>
  </description>
